<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi firm builds $21.3 mln cable production line.</title>
<headline>Saudi firm builds $21.3 mln cable production line.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Saudi Cable Company (SCC) said on Monday it had built a 80 million riyal ($21.3 million) production line to produce high voltage power cables at its plant in the western port city of Jeddah.</p>
<p>An SCC statement said Saudi Industry and Electricity Minister Hashem bin Abdullah bin Hashem Yamani would on Tuesday inaugurate the line which has an annual production capacity of 4,000 tonnes of cables.</p>
<p>($1=3.75 Saudi riyals)</p>
</text>
